{%- comment -%}
  Shared category line-icon lookup. Keyed off a title string (same keyword
  matching used in the "Products" mega menu panel — snippets/itm-mega-menu.liquid
  — so a given category always gets the same icon in both places). The SVG
  markup itself is duplicated here rather than shared via one render, since
  the mega menu snippet is a fragile, heavily-tuned file this deliberately
  avoids touching.

  Usage: {% render 'itm-category-icon', title: collection.title %}
  Outputs raw <svg> markup (uses currentColor) or blank if nothing matches.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign icon_title = title | default: '' | downcase
-%}
